VIn addition, when users access video ads within our product, the ads providers may collect additional stats about videos and video playback such as: start/boot-up information, amount played/session length information, memory on device used for the video cache, videos cached on a device, and complete view events.
p10
I2
sVWhen using our products and services, we may collect non-personal information about the devices of our users, the version of their operating system (\u201cOS\u201d), and general stats about the way our apps are used: how long was the app active, what game settings are used, how far the user has progressed in the app, etc.
p11
I1
sVThe providers of adverts and analytics may share this information with their business partners, such as advertisers, publishers, sponsors, measurement & attribution companies, and advertising services companies.
p12
I1
sVAdditionally, the information may be disclosed to government and law enforcement officials if legal proceedings require it.
p13
I1
sVThe information is used to improve our products and services, to conduct research and to create internal reports for future reference.
p14
I1
sVWhat information do we collect about our users?
p15
I1
sVPlease check this page on a regular basis so that you remain aware of what information we collect and how we use it.
p16
I1
sVOnly generic statistics and aggregated demographic info might be shared with third parties at our discretion.
